# Byproducts of running things.  These were path-scoped before, which let a
# stray sv.log at the repository root through; the patterns are global now.
# Note there is deliberately no global *.toc rule: stata/stata.toc is a
# package file, not a LaTeX table of contents.
*.log
*.aux
*.out
*.smcl
docs/*.toc

# docs/vignette.pdf is committed on purpose -- it is a deliverable, and not
# everyone reading the repository has a LaTeX toolchain.

